                <div class="tnThankYouContent tnThankYouInline" id="tnThankYouInline" hidden>
                    <div class="thankyouDivi">
                        <h3 class="tnThankYouTitle">Thank you for applying</h3>
                        <p class="tnThankYouSub">Thank you for showing interest for The Next Tech 1.0. Our team will contact you shortly.</p>
